==English==
===Noun===
'''taxpayer'''
# a person who is [[subject]] to, [[liable]] for, or [[pay]]s [[tax]]
as opposed to a nontaxpayer who is neither the subject nor the object of revenue laws (Economy Heating vs. United States, 470F2nd,585(1972)).

